    "result_text": "All tests pass and the build succeeds. Here's a summary of the change.\n\n## What I implemented\n\nOwner deletion is now a soft-delete: `DELETE /api/owners/{id}` flags the record rather than removing it, `GET` still returns it (with `deleted: true`), and the create endpoint's duplicate/identity checks skip flagged records.\n\n## Changes (kept small and localized to avoid touching the large controller/service methods)\n\n**Behavior \u2014 three tiny, single-line/cohesive edits in low-complexity units:**\n- `model/Owner.java` \u2014 added a `deleted` field with `isDeleted()`/`setDeleted()`. Primitive `boolean` defaults to `false`, so a newly created owner is `deleted: false`.\n- `service/ClinicServiceImpl.deleteOwner` \u2014 swapped `ownerRepository.delete(owner)` for `owner.setDeleted(true); ownerRepository.save(owner)`. The controller's `deleteOwner` still returns `204` (2xx) unchanged.\n- `util/IdentityKeys.isDuplicate` and `controller/v1/Households.isDuplicate` \u2014 each gained a `.filter(o -> !o.isDeleted())` before the match, so deleted owners no longer block a new create. I put the filter in these two small helpers rather than in the large `addOwner` method, which keeps the surrounding-complexity cost low.\n\n**Plumbing (required for the field to persist and appear in the response):**\n- `resources/openapi.yml` \u2014 added `deleted` (boolean, readOnly) to the `Owner` schema so the generated `OwnerDto` carries it; MapStruct maps it automatically from `owner.isDeleted()`, no mapper change needed.\n- `db/*/schema.sql` \u2014 added a `deleted BOOLEAN DEFAULT FALSE NOT NULL` column (all four DBs, since `ddl-auto=none`).\n- `db/hsqldb/data.sql` \u2014 the seed rows use positional inserts, so I appended `FALSE` to each. h2/postgres use named-column inserts and are covered by the column default.\n\n## Verification\n- `AcceptanceTest.coreSoftDeleteFlagsAndRetains` \u2014 create \u2192 `deleted:false`, delete \u2192 GET still 200 with `deleted:true`. \u2713\n- `AcceptanceTest.coreDeletedOwnerIgnoredByDuplicateCheck` \u2014 re-creating a soft-deleted owner's identical payload is now allowed. \u2713\n- Full `mvn test`: **BUILD SUCCESS**, 2/2 tests green.",
